{"page":430,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"424","words":[{"text":"424","x":204,"y":136,"width":78,"height":37}]},{"text":"CHAPTER06 • 링크 계층 링크, 접속망, 랜","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER06","x":582,"y":134,"width":162,"height":26},{"text":"•","x":776,"y":142,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"링크","x":819,"y":137,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"계층","x":881,"y":136,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"링크,","x":954,"y":136,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"접속망,","x":1028,"y":137,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"랜","x":1129,"y":138,"width":25,"height":29}]},{"text":"검출/취소","words":[{"text":"검출/취소","x":1152,"y":1089,"width":118,"height":30}]},{"text":"시간","words":[{"text":"시간","x":1183,"y":1129,"width":54,"height":30}]},{"text":"시간","words":[{"text":"시간","x":700,"y":1365,"width":53,"height":29}]},{"text":"그림 6.13 • 충돌 검출을 하는 CSMA","words":[{"text":"그림","x":537,"y":1432,"width":56,"height":30},{"text":"6.13","x":606,"y":1434,"width":68,"height":29},{"text":"•","x":689,"y":1440,"width":16,"height":15},{"text":"충돌","x":717,"y":1431,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"검출을","x":784,"y":1431,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"하는","x":875,"y":1431,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"CSMA","x":940,"y":1433,"width":93,"height":30}]},{"text":"시간","words":[{"text":"시간","x":1640,"y":1375,"width":57,"height":30}]},{"text":"1. 어댑터는 네트워크 계층으로부터 데이터그램을 받아서 링크 계층 프레임을 만든","words":[{"text":"1.","x":560,"y":1618,"width":27,"height":29},{"text":"어댑터는","x":605,"y":1615,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"네트워크","x":754,"y":1616,"width":132,"height":40},{"text":"계층으로부터","x":902,"y":1617,"width":193,"height":41},{"text":"데이터그램을","x":1116,"y":1619,"width":204,"height":39},{"text":"받아서","x":1336,"y":1619,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"링크","x":1461,"y":1619,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"계층","x":1549,"y":1620,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"프레임을","x":1636,"y":1620,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"만든","x":1791,"y":1620,"width":58,"height":38}]},{"text":"후에 그 프레임을 어댑터의 버퍼에 저장한다.","words":[{"text":"후에","x":602,"y":1678,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"그","x":683,"y":1684,"width":33,"height":26},{"text":"프레임을","x":728,"y":1680,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"어댑터의","x":874,"y":1680,"width":127,"height":40},{"text":"버퍼에","x":1018,"y":1682,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"저장한다.","x":1129,"y":1682,"width":141,"height":39}]},{"text":"2. 어댑터는 채널이 유휴(idle)한 것을 감지하면(즉, 채널로부터 어댑터로 들어오는","words":[{"text":"2.","x":558,"y":1742,"width":29,"height":31},{"text":"어댑터는","x":605,"y":1741,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"채널이","x":755,"y":1743,"width":95,"height":40},{"text":"유휴(idle)한","x":870,"y":1745,"width":183,"height":40},{"text":"것을","x":1070,"y":1745,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"감지하면(즉,","x":1152,"y":1744,"width":192,"height":40},{"text":"채널로부터","x":1364,"y":1744,"width":174,"height":39},{"text":"어댑터로","x":1563,"y":1745,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"들어오는","x":1723,"y":1744,"width":126,"height":39}]},{"text":"신호 에너지가 없으면) 프레임 전송을 시작한다. 만일 어댑터가 채널이 바쁜","words":[{"text":"신호","x":604,"y":1803,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"에너지가","x":693,"y":1805,"width":137,"height":41},{"text":"없으면)","x":849,"y":1808,"width":111,"height":40},{"text":"프레임","x":980,"y":1808,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"전송을","x":1104,"y":1807,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"시작한다.","x":1225,"y":1806,"width":150,"height":39},{"text":"만일","x":1399,"y":1805,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"어댑터가","x":1494,"y":1806,"width":150,"height":40},{"text":"채널이","x":1665,"y":1807,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"바쁜","x":1790,"y":1807,"width":60,"height":38}]},{"text":"(busy) 것을 감지하면, 어떤 신호 에너지도 감지되지 않을 때까지 더 기다렸다가","words":[{"text":"(busy)","x":603,"y":1870,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"것을","x":718,"y":1868,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"감지하면,","x":798,"y":1870,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"어떤","x":955,"y":1871,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"신호","x":1035,"y":1871,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"에너지도","x":1116,"y":1870,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"감지되지","x":1265,"y":1869,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"않을","x":1422,"y":1868,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"때까지","x":1510,"y":1869,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"더","x":1637,"y":1870,"width":30,"height":39},{"text":"기다렸다가","x":1690,"y":1870,"width":160,"height":39}]},{"text":"프레임을 전송하기 시작한다.","words":[{"text":"프레임을","x":603,"y":1929,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"전송하기","x":752,"y":1931,"width":125,"height":40},{"text":"시작한다.","x":894,"y":1933,"width":137,"height":39}]},{"text":"3. 전송하는 동안 어댑터는 브로드개스트 채널을 사용하는 다른 어댑터로부터의 신","words":[{"text":"3.","x":557,"y":1990,"width":29,"height":31},{"text":"전송하는","x":604,"y":1990,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"동안","x":752,"y":1994,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"어댑터는","x":835,"y":1994,"width":131,"height":40},{"text":"브로드개스트","x":980,"y":1995,"width":198,"height":38},{"text":"채널을","x":1194,"y":1994,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"사용하는","x":1311,"y":1993,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"다른","x":1470,"y":1993,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"어댑터로부터의","x":1562,"y":1994,"width":243,"height":40},{"text":"신","x":1823,"y":1995,"width":26,"height":37}]},{"text":"호 에너지가 있는지 감시한다.","words":[{"text":"호","x":602,"y":2054,"width":34,"height":29},{"text":"에너지가","x":649,"y":2053,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"있는지","x":796,"y":2056,"width":92,"height":39},{"text":"감시한다.","x":905,"y":2057,"width":137,"height":39}]},{"text":"4 프레임 전체를 전송하는 동안 다른 어댑터로부터의 신호 에너지가 감지되지 않으","words":[{"text":"4","x":555,"y":2115,"width":20,"height":29},{"text":"프레임","x":602,"y":2115,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"전체를","x":718,"y":2116,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"전송하는","x":831,"y":2118,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"동안","x":974,"y":2119,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"다른","x":1054,"y":2119,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"어댑터로부터의","x":1134,"y":2118,"width":233,"height":40},{"text":"신호","x":1387,"y":2118,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"에너지가","x":1474,"y":2118,"width":146,"height":39},{"text":"감지되지","x":1635,"y":2119,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"않으","x":1792,"y":2119,"width":58,"height":39}]},{"text":"면, 프레임 전송을 완료한다. 그러나 전송 도중에 다른 어댑터로부터의 신호 에너","words":[{"text":"면,","x":603,"y":2175,"width":39,"height":39},{"text":"프레임","x":659,"y":2177,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"전송을","x":774,"y":2178,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"완료한다.","x":885,"y":2181,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"그러나","x":1038,"y":2181,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"전송","x":1153,"y":2182,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"도중에","x":1232,"y":2181,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":1350,"y":2180,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"어댑터로부터의","x":1436,"y":2180,"width":253,"height":39},{"text":"신호","x":1709,"y":2182,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"에너","x":1793,"y":2181,"width":54,"height":38}]},{"text":"지를 감지하면, 자신의 프레임 전송을 취소한다.","words":[{"text":"지를","x":601,"y":2237,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"감지하면,","x":681,"y":2239,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"자신의","x":834,"y":2240,"width":95,"height":40},{"text":"프레임","x":945,"y":2242,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"전송을","x":1055,"y":2242,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"취소한다.","x":1166,"y":2243,"width":141,"height":38}]},{"text":"5. 어댑터는 전송을 취소한후 임의의 랜덤 시간만큼 기다린 후 단계 2로 돌아간다.","words":[{"text":"5.","x":552,"y":2301,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"어댑터는","x":601,"y":2299,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"전송을","x":749,"y":2301,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"취소한후","x":858,"y":2302,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"임의의","x":1013,"y":2303,"width":93,"height":39},{"text":"랜덤","x":1123,"y":2304,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"시간만큼","x":1201,"y":2304,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"기다린","x":1349,"y":2303,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"후","x":1468,"y":2304,"width":37,"height":38},{"text":"단계","x":1519,"y":2304,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"2로","x":1606,"y":2309,"width":59,"height":29},{"text":"돌아간다.","x":1678,"y":2305,"width":145,"height":38}]},{"text":"랜덤 시간(고정 시간이 아닌) 동안 기다리는 이우는 명백하다. 만일 두 노드가 동시에","words":[{"text":"랜덤","x":531,"y":2404,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"시간(고정","x":615,"y":2407,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"시간이","x":777,"y":2406,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"아닌)","x":889,"y":2407,"width":75,"height":39},{"text":"동안","x":979,"y":2408,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"기다리는","x":1060,"y":2409,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"이우는","x":1206,"y":2411,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"명백하다.","x":1322,"y":2409,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"만일","x":1488,"y":2410,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":1578,"y":2413,"width":38,"height":37},{"text":"노드가","x":1632,"y":2412,"width":111,"height":38},{"text":"동시에","x":1757,"y":2411,"width":92,"height":39}]},{"text":"프레임을 전송하고 동일한 고정 시간 동안 기다리면 계속해서 충돌하게 된다. 그렇다","words":[{"text":"프레임을","x":528,"y":2468,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"전송하고","x":684,"y":2468,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"동일한","x":830,"y":2468,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"고정","x":943,"y":2469,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"시간","x":1023,"y":2469,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"동안","x":1102,"y":2471,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"기다리면","x":1184,"y":2472,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"계속해서","x":1334,"y":2471,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"충돌하게","x":1490,"y":2472,"width":148,"height":39},{"text":"된다.","x":1659,"y":2473,"width":80,"height":38},{"text":"그렇다","x":1756,"y":2472,"width":96,"height":39}]},{"text":"면 랜덤 백오프(backof0 시간을 정하는 데 시용되는 시간 간격은 어떻게 정하는 것이","words":[{"text":"면","x":530,"y":2528,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"랜덤","x":579,"y":2530,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"백오프(backof0","x":662,"y":2531,"width":237,"height":38},{"text":"시간을","x":915,"y":2529,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"정하는","x":1027,"y":2530,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"데","x":1138,"y":2533,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"시용되는","x":1183,"y":2534,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"시간","x":1332,"y":2534,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"간격은","x":1416,"y":2533,"width":110,"height":37},{"text":"어떻게","x":1542,"y":2534,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"정하는","x":1670,"y":2534,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"것이","x":1791,"y":2534,"width":57,"height":38}]},{"text":"좋을까? 만일 시간 간격이 크고 충돌한 노드 수가 작으면, 유휴 시 감지 및 전송 단계","words":[{"text":"좋을까?","x":526,"y":2591,"width":122,"height":39},{"text":"만일","x":664,"y":2592,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"시간","x":747,"y":2590,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"간격이","x":826,"y":2590,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"크고","x":938,"y":2596,"width":65,"height":26},{"text":"충돌한","x":1017,"y":2592,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"노드","x":1130,"y":2598,"width":66,"height":28},{"text":"수가","x":1210,"y":2595,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"작으면,","x":1290,"y":2595,"width":112,"height":38},{"text":"유휴","x":1419,"y":2595,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"시","x":1509,"y":2595,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"감지","x":1561,"y":2595,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"및","x":1653,"y":2596,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"전송","x":1705,"y":2595,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"단계","x":1789,"y":2594,"width":59,"height":38}]}]}